<style>
  body {
    background: #b5926a;
    font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', 'Marker Felt', cursive, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .poster {
    background: #f7f5f0;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 25px 30px 40px 30px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .top-right-note {
    position: absolute;
    top: 15px;
    right: 25px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #222;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .title-block {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .title-line1 {
    font-size: 68px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4a90a4;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #2b6b7d;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: left;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }

  .title-line2 {
    font-size: 58px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #4a90a4;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #2b6b7d;
    text-align: right;
    margin-right: 40px;
    margin-top: -10px;
  }

  .diagram-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    margin: 10px 0 20px 0;
  }

  .label-left-top {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 15px;
    width: 180px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #333;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .label-right-top {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 25px;
    width: 200px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #333;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .label-left-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    left: 10px;
    bottom: -5px;
    width: 190px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #333;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .label-right-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -15px;
    width: 220px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #333;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .earth-circle {
    width: 430px;
    height: 430px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #333;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .quad {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #444;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-align: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .quad-cars {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #9aa0a3 60%, #7ec8d8 40%);
  }

  .quad-trash {
    background: #7cb342;
  }

  .quad-stumps {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #1a2a4a 0%, #1a2a4a 30%, #8fb862 30%, #8fb862 100%);
  }

  .quad-park {
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #7ec8d8 40%, #9aa66b 60%);
  }

  .caption-placeholder {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .letsprotect {
    font-size: 46px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #5a8a3a;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #3a5c26;
    margin: 30px 0 15px 0;
  }

  .list-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .list-text {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 2.1;
  }

  .list-text .indent {
    margin-left: 60px;
  }

  .earth-heart-placeholder {
    width: 170px;
    height: 200px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #555;
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    background: #eef7f3;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="poster">

    <div class="top-right-note">
      顾译文<br>
      六(2)班
    </div>

    <div class="title-block">
      <div class="title-line1">Protect</div>
      <div class="title-line2">the Earth</div>
    </div>

    <div class="diagram-section">
      <div class="label-left-top">Smoke from cars makes<br>the air dirty.</div>
      <div class="label-right-top">Too much plastic is bad<br>for the Earth.</div>
      <div class="label-left-bottom">Rubbish makes the<br>park messy and dirty.</div>
      <div class="label-right-bottom">Trees help keep the<br>air clean.<br>We should not cut down<br>too many trees.</div>

      <div class="earth-circle">
        <div class="quad quad-cars">
          <span class="caption-placeholder">[Illustration: road with two cars &amp; exhaust smoke]</span>
        </div>
        <div class="quad quad-trash">
          <span class="caption-placeholder">[Illustration: plastic bags, bottles, trash scattered]</span>
        </div>
        <div class="quad quad-park">
          <span class="caption-placeholder">[Illustration: park with tree, bench, litter on ground]</span>
        </div>
        <div class="quad quad-stumps">
          <span class="caption-placeholder">[Illustration: night sky, hills with tree stumps, deforestation]</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="letsprotect">Let's protect our Earth!</div>

    <div class="list-section">
      <div class="list-text">
        1. We should not waste water.<br>
        2. We should reuse and save water.<br>
        3. There is not much coal or oil on Earth.<br>
        <span class="indent">We should save energy</span><br>
        4. We should use paper bags and glass bottles.<br>
        5. We should put rubbish in the bin.
      </div>

      <div class="earth-heart-placeholder">
        [Illustration: heart-shaped globe with tap dripping water, bottom-right]
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
